{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7000_place", "source_sha256": "c3bb797acf2abad139a5a085f0081a73dd5f128a0d8ce1546505cf82ac46a259", "ja": "雪山", "zh": "雪山", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7001_p", "source_sha256": "6ffa95abfd71cc00391d35d74eadf3296fd0e0b50b43c3bbf360d93183e70fbd", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n亜美も衣装に着替え終わったはず……どこに行った？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n亚美应该已经换好衣服了……她去哪儿了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7002_011ami", "source_sha256": "3ca038f32c4ba4fe1699be8843ddda309da23e6c830eb9184bf327c78d060d43", "ja": "ゆきやまから　イエティあみが　あらわれた！\nここは一歩も通さないぜーい！　コマンド？", "zh": "雪山上出现了雪怪亚美！\n这里一步也不让你通过哦——！指令？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7003_p", "source_sha256": "71a1162dd1243e5696131c7d9fbc65bdcca89d59ab5da61a838724e250968ebb", "ja": "ああ、そこに隠れてたのか。\n準備は終わったみたいだな。", "zh": "啊，原来你躲在那里啊。\n看来准备已经结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7004_011ami", "source_sha256": "4c5773c916a5307ced5f5f629e00a41e741e4e623718cc6ab76b8015d7bfa1a1", "ja": "も～兄ちゃんってばノリ悪～。ご覧の通り、亜美は\nイエティになりきるために絶賛準備中だよ？", "zh": "真是的～兄哥你太不配合了吧～。正如你所见，亚美\n正在为了彻底化身雪人而全力准备中哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7005_p", "source_sha256": "1d8135f9a5394359d07a08e7b3d15c5ed5de170e1725d9a0f9954adf6a4d205e", "ja": "……もしかして、イメトレってやつか？\nすまん、撮影前にRPGごっこがしたいだけかと。", "zh": "……难道说，这就是所谓的情境模拟训练？\n抱歉，我还以为你只是想在拍摄前玩玩RPG游戏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7006_011ami", "source_sha256": "dc2343f3d76c7833eb822542282ff7d8501b27608d70590bf9ee2b50995a9d5b", "ja": "ふふ～ん兄ちゃん？　ずいぶんヨユーだね……。はっ！\nムボービな兄ちゃんに　イエティあみの　こうげき！", "zh": "哼哼～哥哥？看起来相当游刃有余嘛……啊！\n对毫无防备的哥哥，使出雪怪亚美的攻击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7007", "source_sha256": "0d644e13bc60daf6d9efcfaf44a88750869fa795ad4b2b55f7df094f5ce49666", "ja": "たたかう", "zh": "战斗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7008", "source_sha256": "dd23e6c96700c4af78ba4f045886ad69af9caeca3a8aaf83d5cffbd448ba5da8", "ja": "なかまにする", "zh": "招募为伙伴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7200_p", "source_sha256": "a517de0283b3edc43d2525ede9cee0eff7935c54a73dfed8bdee8a0483eafd6f", "ja": "モンスターが出てきたなら仕方がない。\nここで戦うぞ！", "zh": "既然怪物都出现了，那也没办法了。\n就在这里战斗吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7201_011ami", "source_sha256": "50b4f162a9cb12738b628b2d468f6ed385c9abba280fce709075a468988edd42", "ja": "おお～！　いいよ兄ちゃん！　このイエティあみを\n本気にさせたニンゲンは、お前で百万人目だー！", "zh": "哦哦～！好啊，哥哥！能让这只雪怪亚美认真起来的人，你可是第一百万人啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7202_011ami", "source_sha256": "20d0e0ad825c7ec34103d56b0b26698e0bbb0769508ee2b9dcb7d48886d4594c", "ja": "特別に、寒ーい雪山も溶かす亜美のぷりちーアタックを\nお見舞いするかんね！　撮影も期待しててヨシだよ！", "zh": "特别为你献上能融化冰冷雪山的亚美可爱攻击！  \n拍摄也尽管期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7300_p", "source_sha256": "a517de0283b3edc43d2525ede9cee0eff7935c54a73dfed8bdee8a0483eafd6f", "ja": "モンスターが出てきたなら仕方がない。\nここで戦うぞ！", "zh": "既然怪物都出现了，那也没办法了。\n就在这里战斗吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7301_011ami", "source_sha256": "3a794b99f054ffd50751503a5db7a0c05da4209b4fecaed214838ebbb81e13c5", "ja": "……ん～、兄ちゃん。勢いは買うけど、そのレベルじゃ\nまだまだ亜美に火をつけるには足りませんなあ～。", "zh": "……嗯～，大哥。气势倒是不错，但凭那种等级，\n想点燃亚美的干劲还差得远呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7302_011ami", "source_sha256": "08e2b186b5234274e3625980226abe6fbcb4d8e77f9e28d598a7192fe98ba65e", "ja": "今回は見逃してあげるから、代わりに亜美のテンション\n上げる、ごほうびプリン、よろよろ～♪", "zh": "这次就放过你啦，作为交换，给亚美一个能让她兴奋起来的奖励布丁，拜托啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7500_p", "source_sha256": "71fdefe95ec85ecbac218ab6b8e116b06984c6c10a26c2959e516ca13f3eb26a", "ja": "人とイエティは、仲良くできるはずだ。\nここは仲間にならないか？", "zh": "人类和雪人，应该也是可以友好相处的。\n不如我们成为同伴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7501_011ami", "source_sha256": "8eaf7ff3089d2f0d620637d05502eac8e610cc2b9e046b1f72c7d5867f59b0cf", "ja": "おおっ、イエティあみを仲間にしようとするとは……。\nやはり兄ちゃんは、違いのわかるニンゲンですなぁ。", "zh": "哦哦，居然想让雪怪亚美加入队伍……果然哥哥是个懂得欣赏差异的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7502_011ami", "source_sha256": "cd40aeb23d52bbd69d247e68f5625e9c08799ee719aa108a65f20ac31f695110", "ja": "イエティあみが　なかまになった！　……仲間として、\n美味しいおやつを所望する！　そんで撮影もバッチリ☆", "zh": "雪怪亚美加入队伍了！……作为伙伴，要求提供美味的点心！然后拍摄也要完美搞定☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7600_p", "source_sha256": "71fdefe95ec85ecbac218ab6b8e116b06984c6c10a26c2959e516ca13f3eb26a", "ja": "人とイエティは、仲良くできるはずだ。\nここは仲間にならないか？", "zh": "人类和雪人，应该也是可以友好相处的。\n不如我们成为同伴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7601_011ami", "source_sha256": "6e0e5d8e2b54b88b4547a14b5ee9a72563b44b7b64da51b39615159396a40362", "ja": "ちっちっちっ。甘いね兄ちゃん。そんな簡単に亜美が\n仲間になると思ったら、大間違いだよ？", "zh": "啧啧啧。太天真了吧，大哥。要是以为亚美会这么简单就加入你们，那可就大错特错了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_7602_011ami", "source_sha256": "3dd265f19cb0a5963b75397b3c862434d862d573fde2a922a43b4d652b2bb783", "ja": "ってことでここからが本番だー！　亜美が満足するまで\nもっと遊ん……じゃなかった、戦ってもらうかんね！", "zh": "所以从这里开始才是真正的战斗！在满足亚美之前，就陪亚美再玩……不对，战斗更久一点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
